<title>USA: VIDAMed sees Q2 shr loss $0.38 to $0.41.</title>
<headline>VIDAMed sees Q2 shr loss $0.38 to $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>VIDAMed Inc said Monday it expects a second quarter net loss in the range of $4.5 million to $4.9 million, or $0.38 to $0.41 per share.</p>
<p>Wall Street had anticipated a second quarter loss of $0.28 a share, according to First Call. The company reported a loss of $0.34 a share in the 1996 quarter.</p>
<p>The company said net revenues for the second quarter ended June 30 are expected to approximate $2.1 million, compared to $603,000 in the year-ago quarter.</p>
